# The Net's effect is a resolved one (CR 611.2): once Braided Net has netted Bot2's Vampire Hexmage, Bot1 crafts the Net
# with Mox Jet (CR 702.167a) into Braided Quipu, and the Hexmage still can't activate its ability while it stays tapped.
# Bot2's untap step ends that, and Bot2 sacrifices it then (the positive control). On turn 5 Braided Quipu's ability
# draws a card for each artifact Bot1 controls - the Quipu and Mox Sapphire, two: Opt and Ponder - and then puts the
# Quipu into its owner's library third from the top, where it is Braided Net again (CR 401.1, 712.8a).

